## https://github.com/bensadeh/tailspin#using-the-pager-less
tailspin: (Navigating) Scroll one line up/down          | j/k
tailspin: (Navigating) Scroll one half-page up/down     | d/u
tailspin: (Navigating) Go to the top/bottom of the file | g/G
tailspin: (Follow mode)                                 | `-f`
tailspin: (Follow mode) Stop following                  | C-c
tailspin: (Follow mode) Resume following                | S-f
tailspin: (Search)                                      | /
tailspin: (Search) Find the previous/next instance      | N/n
tailspin: (Filtering)                                   | &
tailspin: (Filtering) Regular expression                | &\($1\|$2\)